{#
    FR-046 — the one distinguishable failure: an invitation that lapsed.

    Told apart from an unknown code on purpose, so the holder knows to ask for a resend rather
    than assume they mistyped it. Returned with 410 Gone.
#}
{% extends 'join/_layout.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}This invitation has expired{% endblock %}
{% block heading %}This invitation has expired{% endblock %}

{% block join_content %}
    <p>
        The invitation from <strong>{{ organizationName }}</strong> is no longer valid. Invitations
        last seven days.
    </p>

    <p>
        Ask {{ organizationName }} to send you a new one{% if targetEmail %} — they can resend it to
        {{ targetEmail }} from their Coaches page{% endif %}.
    </p>
{% endblock %}
